OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWhy are there concerns AI could
OL,4,Athreaten humanity, and how real are
OL,5,Athey?
OL,6,
OL,7,FA slew of warnings about the potential
OL,8,Fdangers of AI have spurred calls for
OL,9,Fcoordinated action to slow the
OL,10,Ftechnology's development.
OL,12,FClaims by current and former
OL,13,Fresearchers that the tech will endanger
OL,14,Fhumanity - with one suggesting there is
OL,15,Fa greater than 10% chance of it
OL,16,F"killing all humans" - have raised
OL,17,Falarm bells.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1789705099
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AWhy are there concerns AI could
OL,4,Athreaten humanity, and how real are
OL,5,Athey?
OL,6,
OL,7,FMajor developers OpenAI and Anthropic
OL,8,Fare urging lawmakers to regulate AI,
OL,9,Fwith Microsoft's AI boss the latest to
OL,10,Fsay rules are needed to prevent a
OL,11,F"silicon species" from eventually
OL,12,Fcompeting with humanity.
OL,14,FBut some have dismissed the calls as an
OL,15,Feffort by big AI developers to cement
OL,16,Ftheir dominance over rivals.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
