OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARTE to boycott Eurovision for second
OL,4,Ayear in a row
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement they said: "RTE feels
OL,7,Fthat Ireland's participation cannot be
OL,8,Fjustified given the appalling and
OL,9,Fongoing loss of lives in Gaza and the
OL,10,Fhumanitarian crisis there which
OL,11,Fcontinues to put the lives of so many
OL,12,Fcivilians at risk."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
